{"tag_name":"v1.7.318-75e0a4f","html_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/thinkly/releases/tag/v1.7.318-75e0a4f","releaseNotes":"- 应用正式改名为 Thinkly（磁盘上是 Thinkly.app，安装包文件名 Thinkly-*）。1.7.317 及更早版本无法在应用内自动升级，需要到官网或 GitHub Release 手动下载安装一次；装好后可以删掉旧的 Goose Note.app。macOS 辅助功能等系统权限需要重新授权。首次启动会自动把原数据目录迁移过来，笔记和设置不受影响。Homebrew 用户执行 `brew update && brew upgrade` 会自动迁到 thinkly cask。\n- 搜索框与 AI 输入对齐，可以换行、贴图片，并用 @ 引用笔记和 Skill；检索仍按笔记正文，点 @ 打开对应笔记。\n- 本地笔记可以把文件拖到正文落下的位置导入，并播放音频和视频；视频可以调速，按住右键临时三倍速。修复粘贴图片和视频时插入失败的问题。\n- 分享选区图片改用页面标题，保存和重命名的文件名收到各系统上限内；主题预览只排版开头一屏并即时显示，不再等待网络字体，笔记本主题去掉点阵。\n- 分屏用强调色标出当前这一格，未选中的不再描边；标题栏可以切换同级笔记，选中后只替换这一格并聚焦，文件夹不能放进分屏。","publishedAt":"2026-10-18T18:50:52Z","assets":[{"name":"Thinkly-1.7.318-arm64.dmg","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/thinkly/releases/download/v1.7.318-75e0a4f/Thinkly-1.7.318-arm64.dmg","sha256":"9af6ad07580c22968966346289291dedcd50897d00ef7e13aa304b448b5e147b"},{"name":"Thinkly-1.7.318.dmg","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/thinkly/releases/download/v1.7.318-75e0a4f/Thinkly-1.7.318.dmg","sha256":"f918176b201f4577db210282d1fe1d8dc9c2fb8beb7218f0e95e880ed3cbe218"},{"name":"Thinkly-1.7.318-arm64-mac.zip","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/thinkly/releases/download/v1.7.318-75e0a4f/Thinkly-1.7.318-arm64-mac.zip","sha256":"277c2179abffb31f55717644687eb4817fb997e32357494dd2a1ff02edd341d5"},{"name":"Thinkly-1.7.318-mac.zip","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/thinkly/releases/download/v1.7.318-75e0a4f/Thinkly-1.7.318-mac.zip","sha256":"18c1d6bea8f6056ab39a5629388e31e83475accde415d4d7797f23a35a3fc210"},{"name":"Thinkly-1.7.318-x64-setup.exe","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/thinkly/releases/download/v1.7.318-75e0a4f/Thinkly-1.7.318-x64-setup.exe","sha256":"464710051f0bc09b86eae85169d240c2c65a197fea82a2c2161945ae158fa3d8"},{"name":"Thinkly-1.7.318-arm64-setup.exe","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/thinkly/releases/downlo